{
  "id": "the-simpsons---7x22---raging-abe-simpson-and-his-grumbling-grandson-in-the-curse-of-the-flying-hellfish",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 7x22 - Raging Abe Simpson And His Grumbling Grandson In The Curse of the Flying Hellfish",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 7x22 - Raging Abe Simpson And His Grumbling Grandson In  The Curse of the Flying Hellfish .en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T21:03:06.264Z",
  "lineCount": 267,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Simpsons",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3903,
      "endMs": 7669
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 10276,
      "endMs": 12471
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Grampa! I don't mind when you spit at home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35268,
      "endMs": 37930
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "But I have to work with these people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38038,
      "endMs": 39972
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Oh, jabber jacks! Schoolhouse don't put out spittoons, I ain't responsible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 40073,
      "endMs": 43975
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "All right, seniors... we'd all love to share in your wisdom, experience, yadda, yadda, yadda.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44077,
      "endMs": 50541
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Let's start with Milhouse's grandfather.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 50650,
      "endMs": 52982
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Uh, how many of you have a house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53086,
      "endMs": 55816
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "All right. Now how many of you drove your house to school today?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55922,
      "endMs": 59619
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Huh? What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 59726,
      "endMs": 61921
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Well, I did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 62028,
      "endMs": 64326
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "No, I'm not Superman. I just own an R.V.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64431,
      "endMs": 68424
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Me and the new wife travel the country searching for adventure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 68535,
      "endMs": 72699
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Last fall, we won a chili cook-off in Beaumont, Texas. - Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72806,
      "endMs": 77709
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "You're livin'in a fool's paradise, Van Houten.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77811,
      "endMs": 80905
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "If you fell down in the shower, that thing'd be your tomb.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81014,
      "endMs": 84074
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Grampa, hush! Here. Why don't you spit some more?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84184,
      "endMs": 87950
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "No, I'm not Superman. I'm a judge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88054,
      "endMs": 92184
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Why, just this morning I sentenced my 46th man to death.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92292,
      "endMs": 95819
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "No, 47 th.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 95929,
      "endMs": 97988
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Wow, 47! I love you, Grandpa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100133,
      "endMs": 103830
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Yeah, well, I may not have a fancy black bathrobe... and a hammer like Snooty... but I do have slippers and an oatmeal spoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103937,
      "endMs": 112167
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Look! Bart, perhaps your grandfather... would like to come up front now and give someone else a chance to interrupt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 112278,
      "endMs": 118847
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Oh, please, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118952,
      "endMs": 120852
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "About time, knothead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120954,
      "endMs": 123650
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Now- Hey, listen!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123756,
      "endMs": 128455
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Now, my story begins in nineteen dickety-two.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128561,
      "endMs": 131689
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "We had to say \"dickety,\" 'cause the kaiser had stolen our word \"twenty. \" I chased that rascal to get it back... but gave up after dickety-six miles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131798,
      "endMs": 141740
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Dickety? Highly dubious.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141841,
      "endMs": 144776
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "What are you cackling at, fatty? Too much pie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144878,
      "endMs": 146846
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "That's your problem.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146946,
      "endMs": 149073
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Now, I'd like to digress from my prepared remarks... to discuss how I invented the \"terlet. \" Terlet. Ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149182,
      "endMs": 159291
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Stop your snickering! I spent three years on that terlet!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159392,
      "endMs": 162293
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "And then he claimed he was the one who turned cats and dogs against each other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170236,
      "endMs": 174400
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Why is he always making up those crazy stories?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174507,
      "endMs": 177442
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Maybe it's time we put Grampa in a home. You already put him in a home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177544,
      "endMs": 180843
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Maybe it's time we put him in one where he can't get out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180947,
      "endMs": 183541
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "No! Old people deserve our respect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183650,
      "endMs": 185550
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Look atJacques Cousteau and Goldie Hawn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185652,
      "endMs": 187882
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "You wouldn't shut them away like second-class citizens.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187987,
      "endMs": 190217
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Second-class!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190323,
      "endMs": 192223
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "What about Social Security, bus discounts... medic alert jewelry, Gold Bond powder... pants all the way up to your armpits... and all those other senior perks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192325,
      "endMs": 202233
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Oh, if you ask me, old folks have it pretty sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 202335,
      "endMs": 205270
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Mm, let's see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206673,
      "endMs": 209437
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 209542,
      "endMs": 212773
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Eh, this junk was hardly worth gettin' up for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219419,
      "endMs": 222183
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Maybe if I go back to sleep for a few days, some good mail will build up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222288,
      "endMs": 226190
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Hey, what's this? \"Asa Phelps has\"- The seventh Hellfish is dead!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226292,
      "endMs": 232930
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "That means the fortune's almost mine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233032,
      "endMs": 236900
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Asa Phelps spent his entire life in Springfield... except for a four-year service in World War II and one high school day trip.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245044,
      "endMs": 254451
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "He worked at the United Strut and Bracing Works as a molders boy... until he was replaced by a Moldermatic and died.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254554,
      "endMs": 263986
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Would you do the honors?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279379,
      "endMs": 281313
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Well, Simpson, seven gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286686,
      "endMs": 289587
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "As soon as you're in your pressboard coffin...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289689,
      "endMs": 292249
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "I'll be the sole survivor, and the treasure will be mine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292358,
      "endMs": 294826
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Over my dead body it will!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294927,
      "endMs": 296827
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "That's exactly the point!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296929,
      "endMs": 298920
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Oh, Simpson, can't you go five seconds without humiliating yourself?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 299032,
      "endMs": 303435
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "How long was that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 306706,
      "endMs": 309402
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Your clownish behavior notwithstanding... we have made a gentleman's agreement... and sworn on our lives to honor it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309509,
      "endMs": 316676
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Smithers, I want that man killed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316783,
      "endMs": 319616
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Well, let's see. Mesmerists, dowsers, Luddites, alienists...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326326,
      "endMs": 329557
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Zoroastrians, alphabetizers- Aha! Assassins!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329662,
      "endMs": 334266
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "I was wondering, sir. Do we really need to, uh... settle Abe Simpson?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334367,
      "endMs": 339103
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "I mean, I'm familiar with his physical state... and perhaps if we wait, nature will assassinate him for us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339205,
      "endMs": 343935
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Well, I can't risk it. I won't allow that Simpson boy to take the Hellfish bonanza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 344043,
      "endMs": 348036
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "And I can't get it without his key.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 348147,
      "endMs": 350240
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Ah, just the man I need.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350350,
      "endMs": 352910
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Fernando Vidal, the world's most devious assassin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353019,
      "endMs": 357251
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Hola. Fernando, it's M.B.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361361,
      "endMs": 364125
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Ah, Marion Barry. Is it time for another shipment already?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364230,
      "endMs": 367927
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Oi! This is Montgomery Burns! Oh, caramba.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 368034,
      "endMs": 371834
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "I'm sending you a photo over the Faxtrola.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371938,
      "endMs": 374702
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I need you to fly to Springfield and assassinate this man posthaste.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374807,
      "endMs": 378504
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Ah, Del Monte.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383583,
      "endMs": 386108
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Enjoy them, old man. They will be your last.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388020,
      "endMs": 391456
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Hey, what the- I'm up! I'm up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402068,
      "endMs": 404798
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Ah, he's more clever than he looks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408674,
      "endMs": 412337
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Abraham Simpson, your family is here to visit you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415248,
      "endMs": 418706
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Hot diggety! My family's come to visit me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418818,
      "endMs": 421787
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "It-Wait a minute!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421888,
      "endMs": 424755
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "My family never comes to vi-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424857,
      "endMs": 428349
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "D'oh! Not again!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 430163,
      "endMs": 432654
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "I can't take much more of your blundering numskullery.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432765,
      "endMs": 435825
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I'll be in the car, dudes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435935,
      "endMs": 437835
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "There is one more way to kill a man... but it is as intricate and precise... as a well-played game of chess.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442308,
      "endMs": 450941
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Was that me, or was that you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455755,
      "endMs": 457746
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Help! Nurse! Someone's trying to kill me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463796,
      "endMs": 467562
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Okay, we'll do something about that right away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467667,
      "endMs": 470227
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Let's start by doubling your medication.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470336,
      "endMs": 472998
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Our residents... are trying... to nap!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476442,
      "endMs": 481402
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Ah.! Let me in.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 482815,
      "endMs": 484942
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Someone's trying to kill me.! Sweet merciful McGillicutty.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485051,
      "endMs": 488418
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "You gotta open the door.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 488521,
      "endMs": 491115
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Who is it? It's Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491224,
      "endMs": 493522
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "And it sounds like he's gotten into the horseradish again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493626,
      "endMs": 497255
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "And then a knife flew at my head!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497363,
      "endMs": 500457
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "And you were there... and you were there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500566,
      "endMs": 504902
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Uh, Grampa, maybe I should moisten your washcloth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505004,
      "endMs": 507336
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "It's plenty moist! Listen!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507440,
      "endMs": 509340
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Monty Burns is trying to kill me, and it's all because- Uh, um, I can't tell you why.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509442,
      "endMs": 515107
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Well, I'm sure you'll make up something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515214,
      "endMs": 517205
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Maybe you just need more of my classmates around.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517316,
      "endMs": 519614
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I gotta hole up here for a while. They might still be after me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 519719,
      "endMs": 523314
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Wow! He's even more agitated than usual.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 524790,
      "endMs": 527224
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Maybe we should let him stay. Where are we going to put him?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527326,
      "endMs": 530124
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Bart's room. Bart's room.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530229,
      "endMs": 531287
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Bart's room. Dumpster.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 531397,
      "endMs": 532864
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Sorry to crowd you, boy, but I'll let you in on a secret.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537670,
      "endMs": 541970
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Burns is after me 'cause he wants the Hellfish bonanza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 542074,
      "endMs": 546374
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Look, if you're gonna stay in my room... could you at least stop making up gibberish?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546479,
      "endMs": 550707
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Gibberish, eh? Then what's this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550816,
      "endMs": 553614
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Wrinkly gibberish?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553719,
      "endMs": 556620
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "I got this in the Second World War II.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556722,
      "endMs": 561716
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Back then I was known as Sergeant Simpson... and I commanded the Flying Hellfish... the fightingest squad in the fightingest company... in the third-fightingest battalion in the army.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561827,
      "endMs": 575406
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "We were all from Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575508,
      "endMs": 577601
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "There was Police Chief Wiggum's father, Iggy Wiggum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577710,
      "endMs": 580736
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Um, if anybody finds a grenade without a pin, that's mine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580846,
      "endMs": 585783
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Our radioman, Sheldon Skinner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585885,
      "endMs": 588285
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "All right, very funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588387,
      "endMs": 591481
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Well, I didn't join the service to make friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591591,
      "endMs": 595049
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "And watching our backs was Private Fifth Class Arnie Gumble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595161,
      "endMs": 598892
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Then there was also Griff, Asa, Ox and Etch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601000,
      "endMs": 603230
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "But every unit has a troublemaker.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 603336,
      "endMs": 605566
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Ours was a cocky little private named Montgomery Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605671,
      "endMs": 610199
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Haven't you won the war yet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 610309,
      "endMs": 613403
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Duh, hey! You said you was dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613512,
      "endMs": 616709
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Yes. Dead tired. But I'm quite refreshed now. Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 616816,
      "endMs": 621651
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. You bossed around the richest, most powerful guy in town?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621754,
      "endMs": 625588
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "How come you were a sergeant and he was only a private?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625691,
      "endMs": 628592
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Well, he got busted down for obstructing a probe from J. Edgar Hoover.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628694,
      "endMs": 633131
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "We got stuck with him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 633232,
      "endMs": 635132
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Now they'll never save your brain, Hitler.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637370,
      "endMs": 641466
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Little help?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644176,
      "endMs": 647009
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Boom! Boom it went! Boom! Just like that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 652385,
      "endMs": 656151
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "They took a photo of my keister for Stars and Stripes.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656255,
      "endMs": 659691
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "At least they told me it was for Stars and Stripes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659792,
      "endMs": 662727
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Well, if you saved Burns's life, why does he want to kill you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662828,
      "endMs": 665729
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "It was the closing days of the war.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665831,
      "endMs": 667890
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "We had just flushed some Germans out of an abandoned castle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668000,
      "endMs": 671492
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Hey! Burnsie found some pictures.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677076,
      "endMs": 679738
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Wait a minute. We ain't-a supposed to steal from civilians.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679845,
      "endMs": 683508
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "You want me to report you to Commander Flanders? Just leave them, Burnsie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683616,
      "endMs": 686915
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Leave them for whom? The Germans?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687019,
      "endMs": 688919
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "The folks who shoot at us all day? Let's just take them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689021,
      "endMs": 691751
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "We'll all be rich- rich as Nazis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691857,
      "endMs": 693916
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Wow! I'd like to be as rich as the Nazis!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694026,
      "endMs": 696620
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Think of what a guy could get himself with that kind of scratch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696729,
      "endMs": 699425
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Yeah. I could buy chicken dinners three times a day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699532,
      "endMs": 702330
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "I could buy a brand-new Studebaker with a fan on the dashboard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702435,
      "endMs": 705632
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I could buy my way into high- society.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705738,
      "endMs": 709469
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Well, I don't feel right about it... but I could use a nest egg for retirement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709575,
      "endMs": 714143
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "I'd hate to wind up in one of them old folks' homes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714246,
      "endMs": 716942
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Then it's agreed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717049,
      "endMs": 718949
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Of course, we can't sell the paintings now. We'd be caught.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719051,
      "endMs": 722077
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "How many of you are familiar with the concept of a tontine?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722188,
      "endMs": 725248
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "All right, Ox. Why don't you take us through it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 728194,
      "endMs": 730719
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Uhh, essentially, we all enter into a contract... whereby the last surviving participant... becomes the sole possessor of all them \"perty\" pictures.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730830,
      "endMs": 740036
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Well put, Oxford. Now remember, you can't all sign with an \"X.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 740139,
      "endMs": 745042
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "So we sealed up the paintings... knowing only one of us would ever look upon them again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746846,
      "endMs": 753242
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Ox was the first to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 756288,
      "endMs": 758188
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "He got a hernia carrying the crate out of the castle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758290,
      "endMs": 761259
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Five more men died in the Veterans Day float disaster of'79.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761360,
      "endMs": 765592
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Now, with Asa gone, it's down to me and Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765698,
      "endMs": 769600
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Great story, Grampa. Could've used a vampire though. Night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769702,
      "endMs": 773194
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "My own grandson thinks I'm a liar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773305,
      "endMs": 777366
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Don't kill me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781380,
      "endMs": 784008
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "I've tried to meet you halfway on this, Simpson... but you had to be littleJohnny Live-A-Lot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784116,
      "endMs": 789214
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Now give me your key to the Hellfish bonanza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789321,
      "endMs": 792313
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Oh, wow! There really is a treasure!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792424,
      "endMs": 794858
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Whatever you do, don't give him the key, Grampa. Here's the key.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 794960,
      "endMs": 797656
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Aw, figures. Hey, Mr. Burns!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797763,
      "endMs": 800630
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Can I go with you to get the treasure?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800733,
      "endMs": 802633
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "I won't eat much, and I don't know the difference between right and wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 802735,
      "endMs": 805397
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Oh, you're a good boy... but the child labor people have been watching me like a hawk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 805504,
      "endMs": 810202
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Well, I'm off to get the paintings. As they say, \"time is Monets. \" As you were, Sergeant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810309,
      "endMs": 816441
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Oh, terribly sorry. Back to sleep, little girl.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818083,
      "endMs": 820813
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Santa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820920,
      "endMs": 822820
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "I guess Burns is finally gonna be rich.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 827626,
      "endMs": 830925
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Not without the keys he isn't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831030,
      "endMs": 833260
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Hey, you got the keys!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834400,
      "endMs": 836300
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Now we can get the treasure! Oh, what's the use?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836402,
      "endMs": 839530
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Burns would still find some way to take it from me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839638,
      "endMs": 843472
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I can't believe you, Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843576,
      "endMs": 845510
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "The sergeant in that story you told would never be scared of a dork like Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845611,
      "endMs": 849479
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "You gotta get that treasure. You gotta do it for Ox and Asa and Griff and Burnsie!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849582,
      "endMs": 853643
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Well, not so much Burnsie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 853752,
      "endMs": 855879
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "You really think I can do it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855988,
      "endMs": 859014
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Uh, yes. But we gotta act fast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859124,
      "endMs": 862753
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Where are you two going at this hour?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862862,
      "endMs": 865126
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "On a treasure hunt. Oh, can I come?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865231,
      "endMs": 867290
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Only if you're ready to stare danger in the face... put your manhood to the ultimate test and take- Pass.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867399,
      "endMs": 875366
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Hey, Grampa, do you think your dead buddies get up and walk around at night?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878577,
      "endMs": 881944
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "If they're anything like me, they have to get up twice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882047,
      "endMs": 884413
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Okay, hold up here. Fellas, it's me, Sarge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884516,
      "endMs": 888418
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "At ease. I know I'm bending the rules tonight... but I also know none of you wants that skunk Burns to take our treasure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888520,
      "endMs": 895818
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "And I want you to know that when I die... you're all welcome to visit me in Rich Man's Heaven.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895928,
      "endMs": 904861
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Now it's gonna show us exactly where to dig.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924924,
      "endMs": 927984
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "D'oh.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937336,
      "endMs": 939304
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Boy, you borrow us some diving equipment while I borrow this boat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939405,
      "endMs": 943068
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Well, howdy-doodilly, stranger. Couldn't help but notice you stealing my boat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944977,
      "endMs": 948413
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "I'll bring it back. You ever operated a power boat?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948514,
      "endMs": 951074
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "No. Know anything about water safety?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951183,
      "endMs": 954016
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "No. What do you need it for?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 954119,
      "endMs": 956053
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "It's a secret. Ooh, sounds spine-tingly-dingling.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956155,
      "endMs": 959022
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Just promise you'll have a good time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959124,
      "endMs": 961718
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Maude! Boys! Come on up! We're gonna have a little campout in the dinghy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961827,
      "endMs": 965490
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Yea.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965597,
      "endMs": 967497
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Now remember the plan, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972104,
      "endMs": 974595
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "If you run out of air, tug on the rope- Sixty-four times. No more, no less. Got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974707,
      "endMs": 979274
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "No, no! Sixty-three times if you're out of air!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979378,
      "endMs": 982006
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Sixty-four is if you've found the treasure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982114,
      "endMs": 984309
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Gotcha. Hey, Grampa, do you think I could've been a Flying Hellfish?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984416,
      "endMs": 988785
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "You're a gutsy daredevil with a give-'em-hell attitude and a fourth-grade education.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988887,
      "endMs": 993790
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "You could've made sergeant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993892,
      "endMs": 996486
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1012745,
      "endMs": 1015077
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Sixty-one, 62, 63- Oh, no! Sixty-three! He's out of air!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027526,
      "endMs": 1037799
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "I've sent my only grandson to a watery grave!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1037903,
      "endMs": 1041134
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Sixty-four! He found the treasure! I'm rich!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1041240,
      "endMs": 1046075
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "You're one heck of a grandson, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052117,
      "endMs": 1054312
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Now let's break her open and have a look-see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054420,
      "endMs": 1057412
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Oh! Hey- Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066131,
      "endMs": 1068964
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Huh. The light must've burned out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069068,
      "endMs": 1071298
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "I'll thank you to stop pinching my Botticelli.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073505,
      "endMs": 1077168
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Looks like I didn't need the keys after all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077276,
      "endMs": 1079301
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "I'll take the masterpieces. Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079411,
      "endMs": 1081470
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Consarn it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081580,
      "endMs": 1083741
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "You coward! You're an embarrassment to the name Hellfish!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1087453,
      "endMs": 1090980
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Oh, am I?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091090,
      "endMs": 1092990
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "No! Look! Take the art if you want. Just don't hurt the boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093092,
      "endMs": 1097119
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Hmm. I'd rather do both.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097229,
      "endMs": 1099527
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "So long, Sarge. See you at the reunion in November.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109208,
      "endMs": 1113235
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Mm-mmm. Mm-mmm. Mm-mmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138203,
      "endMs": 1141570
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I'm sorry I cost you your fortune, Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150582,
      "endMs": 1153949
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Ah, the fortune doesn't matter, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154052,
      "endMs": 1156748
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "The important thing is you're safe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1156855,
      "endMs": 1159483
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Now let's get that fortune!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1159591,
      "endMs": 1161525
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "They're gaining on us, sir. We'll have to jettison something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1163962,
      "endMs": 1166362
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "It's been an honor to serve you, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168800,
      "endMs": 1170995
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Consarn it! He's getting away!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172604,
      "endMs": 1174401
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "In a pig's eye he is!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174506,
      "endMs": 1176406
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Act your age, Simpson! You look foolish!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1186118,
      "endMs": 1189053
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Don't kill me. I ain't gonna kill ya.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1204670,
      "endMs": 1207662
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "That'd be cowardly. Monty Burns cowardly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207773,
      "endMs": 1210742
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "I just wanna watch you squirm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1210842,
      "endMs": 1214642
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Yes, sir. Is this to your liking?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214746,
      "endMs": 1217112
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Now, Burnsie, there's one thing we don't stand for in the Hellfish... and that's trying to kill your commanding officer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1222454,
      "endMs": 1228725
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "So consider this your dishonorable discharge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1228827,
      "endMs": 1232228
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "You're out of my unit. You're out of the tontine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1232331,
      "endMs": 1235129
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "And that means the paintings are mine!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1235234,
      "endMs": 1237725
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Private, you are dismissed!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1237836,
      "endMs": 1241237
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "You're rich, Grampa! You did it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1243308,
      "endMs": 1246175
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "And Burns can never take that away from you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1246278,
      "endMs": 1248940
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Freeze! U.S. State Department. We'll take those.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1251883,
      "endMs": 1255250
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "We've been helping the German government search for this stolen art for 50 years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1255354,
      "endMs": 1258687
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "To avoid an international incident, we'll be returning it... to the descendant of its rightful owner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1258790,
      "endMs": 1264893
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Baron Von Bertzenberger, on behalf of the American people, I apologize for- Ja, ja, ja. Mach schnell mit the art things, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1264997,
      "endMs": 1272470
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "I must get back to Dance Central in Stuttgart in time to see Kraftwerk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1272571,
      "endMs": 1277804
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Hey, und, dummkopf! Watch out for the CD changer in my trunk, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1277909,
      "endMs": 1281811
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Idiot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1281913,
      "endMs": 1283813
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "I guess he deserves it more than I do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1288287,
      "endMs": 1291256
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Well, at least I got to show you I wasn't always a pathetic old kook.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1291356,
      "endMs": 1296726
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "You never were, Grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1297929,
      "endMs": 1299863
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Oh, I'd hug ya, but I know you'd just get embarrassed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1299965,
      "endMs": 1305164
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "I won't get embarrassed. I don't care who knows I love my grampa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1305270,
      "endMs": 1308501
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Hey, fun boys! Get a room!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1309975,
      "endMs": 1312603
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1361793,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 7,
    "episode": 22
  }
}
